<title>USA: GT Global launches floating rate fund.</title>
<headline>GT Global launches floating rate fund.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>GT Global Financial Services Inc said it introduced the GT Global Floating Rate Fund that will invest in senior secured floating rate loans and corporate debt securities.</p>
<p>GT Global said it was seeing to achieve high current income with less volatility than other fixed income investments.</p>
<p>GT Global is a unit of LGT Liechtenstein Trust.</p>
</text>
